{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 130,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        69.31520080566406,
        139.39610290527344,
        82.22920227050781
      ],
      "text": "Acceptability",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        91.66522979736328,
        527.0029296875,
        104.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "A consistently positive sentiment was expressed for the acceptability and potential utility of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        105.66522979736328,
        527.0308837890625,
        118.81022644042969
      ],
      "text": "targeted NGS technology. Targeted NGS was seen as a “major advancement” in molecular",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        119.66522979736328,
        171.21859741210938,
        132.8102264404297
      ],
      "text": "MDR-TB diagnostics.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        139.4171142578125,
        524.4478759765625,
        152.56211853027344
      ],
      "text": "1.\t The main reasons for the  high level of acceptability were the comprehensiveness",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        154.9171142578125,
        527.1591186523438,
        168.06211853027344
      ],
      "text": "(resistance diagnosis for more drugs and for the newest and repurposed drugs),  the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        170.4171142578125,
        527.1766967773438,
        183.56211853027344
      ],
      "text": "(as compared with culture samples),  convenience of using a sputum sample and the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        185.9171142578125,
        526.8353271484375,
        199.06211853027344
      ],
      "text": "(quick results compared with phenotypic testing times; 3–5 days as compared  rapidity",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        201.4171142578125,
        167.39561462402344,
        214.56211853027344
      ],
      "text": "with 4–6 weeks).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.4210205078125,
        527.1610717773438,
        238.56602478027344
      ],
      "text": "2.\t There was also the sense that there is  a good window of opportunity to benefit from",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        240.9210205078125,
        526.985107421875,
        254.06602478027344
      ],
      "text": "that is, the technology is arriving at the right  the utility of targeted NGS technology;",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        256.4210205078125,
        527.019287109375,
        269.5660400390625
      ],
      "text": "time, given that resistance to newer TB drugs is likely to increase as the use of these drugs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        271.9210205078125,
        170.31068420410156,
        285.0660400390625
      ],
      "text": "becomes routine.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        296.0789794921875,
        123.78709411621094,
        308.99298095703125
      ],
      "text": "Feasibility",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.9289245605469,
        527.0361938476562,
        333.0739440917969
      ],
      "text": "Although there was high praise for the capability and potential utility of targeted NGS",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.4289245605469,
        527.1624145507812,
        348.5739440917969
      ],
      "text": "technology,  several challenges were identified when testing samples using the targeted",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.9289245605469,
        527.1350708007812,
        364.0739440917969
      ],
      "text": "which may limit the feasibility of targeted NGS for routine uptake at the  NGS platforms,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        366.4289245605469,
        527.080322265625,
        379.5739440917969
      ],
      "text": "present time. The overall sentiment was that the targeted NGS technology needs to be further",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.990996360778809,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        381.9289245605469,
        410.8922119140625,
        395.0739440917969
      ],
      "text": "developed before it can be considered fully ready for operational use.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        404.43292236328125,
        322.4540100097656,
        417.57794189453125
      ],
      "text": "The following feasibility challenges were identified:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        268.38018798828125,
        424.184814453125,
        526.963623046875,
        437.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "Multiple problems were identified with starting and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        424.33880615234375,
        79.11609649658203,
        437.2528076171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        79.11609649658203,
        424.33880615234375,
        268.3763427734375,
        437.2528076171875
      ],
      "text": "Start-up and setting-up challenges:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        439.684814453125,
        526.9091796875,
        452.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "setting up the technology. These problems related to the newness of the technology and",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        455.184814453125,
        526.9531860351562,
        468.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "the trial setting, importing technology and specialist supplies, lack of in-country technical",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        470.684814453125,
        462.6311950683594,
        483.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "assistance for problem-solving and need for more hands-on training practice.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        289.7651062011719,
        486.184814453125,
        527.0902099609375,
        499.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "Targeted NGS technology was seen as a high",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        486.33880615234375,
        79.11609649658203,
        499.2528076171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        79.11609649658203,
        486.33880615234375,
        289.529296875,
        499.2528076171875
      ],
      "text": "High technical complexity of the test:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        501.684814453125,
        526.6561279296875,
        514.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "complexity molecular test that was technically challenging. For example, preparing the",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        517.184814453125,
        527.3189086914062,
        530.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "sample for sequencing involves multiple steps that require attention to detail and precision,",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.981134414672852,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        532.684814453125,
        527.0267333984375,
        545.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "leaving little room for error. Preparation of the library is particularly complex for the Deeplex",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.972565650939941,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        548.184814453125,
        526.9310302734375,
        561.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "platform, although both the Deeplex and the Nanopore platforms are quite complex. In",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        563.684814453125,
        527.0192260742188,
        576.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "both platforms, it was thought that there were too few opportunities for early recognition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        579.184814453125,
        363.43359375,
        592.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "and correction of errors, increasing the risk of failed runs.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        479.7047119140625,
        594.684814453125,
        526.9761962890625,
        607.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "Because",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        594.8388061523438,
        79.11609649658203,
        607.7528076171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        79.11609649658203,
        594.8388061523438,
        479.3398132324219,
        607.7528076171875
      ],
      "text": "Specialized laboratory infrastructure and human resource requirements:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        610.184814453125,
        526.6912231445312,
        623.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "targeted NGS is a molecular-based testing platform, it requires highly specialized laboratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978428840637207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        625.684814453125,
        527.280517578125,
        638.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "infrastructure (e.g. multiple rooms to prevent amplicon contamination and specialized cold",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.989444732666016,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        641.184814453125,
        526.97509765625,
        654.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "storage facilities). Also, highly specialized molecular and medical scientists are needed to",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        656.684814453125,
        526.9642333984375,
        669.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "perform the tests. In LMIC settings, such specialized laboratory infrastructure and staff may",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        672.184814453125,
        460.5729675292969,
        685.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "only be available at centralized laboratories (i.e. not at regional laboratories).",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        313.0588073730469,
        687.684814453125,
        526.9426879882812,
        700.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "In addition to highly specialized laboratory",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        687.8388061523438,
        79.11609649658203,
        700.7528076171875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        79.11609649658203,
        687.8388061523438,
        313.0583190917969,
        700.7528076171875
      ],
      "text": "Special requirements for operating the test:",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        703.184814453125,
        527.106201171875,
        716.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "infrastructure and staff, the testing technology also requires an uninterrupted supply of",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        718.684814453125,
        526.683349609375,
        731.829833984375
      ],
      "text": "electricity, high internet connectivity, high computer capacity, clean water and temperature",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.978479385375977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03929901123047,
        734.184814453125,
        440.1579895019531,
        747.329833984375
      ],
      "text": "controls – requirements that may pose challenges in some LMIC settings.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        38.466400146484375,
        802.0169067382812,
        138.45811462402344,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "114 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        138.4571075439453,
        802.0169067382812,
        177.0811309814453,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        177.0803985595703,
        802.0169067382812,
        288.38323974609375,
        811.576904296875
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Fourth edition",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}